  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In the bronze main hall of the San Cha Mountain blessed land, Fang Yuan finishes a Gu like a beetle with a big graceful belly, pointed head and tail, no legs or antennas, vague like a carving on crude earthenware and grey as stone.",
        "chapters": [
          389
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_san_cha_mountain",
          "char_fang_yuan"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After lifespan Gu steps, Fang Yuan holds a golden peanut-shell Gu with scarlet blood-trace markings. The first false second aperture Gu could only survive for a week and was unstable; this Gu can survive for forty years. At that step the real second aperture Gu has already formed and is nurturing in the peanut shell, and only a strong external force from rank six divine travel Gu can eliminate the false and make it real.",
        "chapters": [
          391
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "forty-year-shell",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "gu_second_aperture_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "After waiting for a blessed land tremor to pass, Fang Yuan throws the false second aperture Gu into the cauldron and again covers it with combusting immortal essence smoke.",
        "chapters": [
          402
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "restart-of-the-same-step",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When a new peanut-shell Gu lands in his hand, the earlier fake second aperture Gu could live only a week, while this new Gu can survive for forty years.",
        "chapters": [
          403
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "new-peanut-shell-after-restart",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      }
    ]
  },
